  "configuration_id": "config_016",
  "reason": "RNA-only PCA singleprofile is much stronger than image-only ResNet singleprofile, so RNA is informative while image alone is weak. The key uncertainty is whether image features are complementary and whether simple fusion can improve over the RNA-only baseline. config_016 uses the same RNA and image encoders/profiles as the completed baselines and adds concat fusion, isolating the fusion effect without changing representation, profile, or aggregation. It is the best next use of budget because it directly tests the central multimodal question; a gain justifies further multimodal fusion/aggregation experiments, while a null or negative result redirects effort to RNA-only improvements."
}

